<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE THIRD STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE THIRD STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BEAUMES-DE-VENISE, France 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading</p>
<p>placings in Wednesday's third stage of the Dauphine Libere cycle</p>
<p>race over 208 kms from Le Puy:</p>
<p>1. Dzhamolidin Abduzhaparov (Uzbekistan) Lotto  five hours 28</p>
<p>minutes 08 seconds</p>
<p>2. Giovanni Lombardi (Italy) Telekom</p>
<p>3. Damien Nazon (France) Francaise des Jeux</p>
<p>4. Philippe Gaumont (France) Cofidis</p>
<p>5. Adriano Baffi (Italy) US Postal</p>
<p>6. Gordon Fraser (Canada) Mutuelle de Seine-et-Marne</p>
<p>7. Nicolas Jalabert (France) Cofidis</p>
<p>8. Frederic Moncassin (France) GAN</p>
<p>9. Laurent Brochard (France) Festina</p>
<p>10. Jans Koerts (Netherlands) Rabobank  all same time as the</p>
<p>winner</p>
<p>Overall</p>
<p>1. Vyacheslav Yekimov (Russia) US Postal  16 hours three</p>
<p>minutes eight seconds</p>
<p> 2. Alex Zuelle (Switzerland) ONCE	     12 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Abraham Olano (Spain) Banesto		15 secs</p>
<p> 4. Brochard					   17</p>
